        <span class="badge badge-stable">stable</span>
        <div class="proj-desc">Modern string extraction for binary analysis — all of the good stuff, none of the garbage. Useful for triage, C2 enumeration, credential extraction, and YARA signature development.</div>
        <div class="proj-links">
          <a href="/stng/">Details</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/atomdrift-project/stng" target="_blank">Source</a>
